OL,3,ATrump criticises AI boss who called for
OL,4,Aslowdown and says only guardrail needed
OL,5,Ais a 'smart president'
OL,6,
OL,7,FTech stocks in Asia, Europe and the US
OL,8,Ffall after the bosses of artificial
OL,9,Fintelligence (AI) companies called for
OL,10,Fa slow down in the pace of its
OL,11,Fdevelopment
OL,13,FThe head of AI company Anthropic, Dario
OL,14,FAmodei, said on Saturday the pace of
OL,15,Fdevelopment should be slowed "to reduce
OL,16,Fthe risk that something goes seriously
OL,17,Fwrong"
OL,19,FGrok founder Elon Musk said Amodoei was
OL,20,F"right", while OpenAI CEO Sam Altman
OL,21,Fsaid standards are "not at a place" to
OL,22,Fpush AI capabilities much further
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
