OL,3,ATrump criticises AI boss who called for
OL,4,Aslowdown and says only guardrail needed
OL,5,Ais a 'smart president'
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump says there is
OL,8,F"a SICK conspiracy going on against AI
OL,9,Fand Data Centers" and insists the US is
OL,10,F"leading China" on AI
OL,12,FIf American AI firms slow down, China
OL,13,Fcould catch up, writes our China
OL,14,Fcorrespondent
OL,16,FIt comes after Jacob Coxon, a
OL,17,Fresearcher who quit Anthropic, told the
OL,18,FBBC staff developing AI systems were
OL,19,F"genuinely frightened" for the future
OL,20,Fof humanity
